co vigente e com o pactuado entre as partes –  Decisão mantida –  Aplicação do art. 252 do Regimento Interno do TJSP –  Apelo improvido\".\r\n\r\n\"ÔNUS - SUCUMBÊNCIA –  Tendo em vista o trabalho adicional desenvolvido, em sede recursal, majoram-se os honorários advocatícios, devidos pela apelante, de 10% para 15% sobre o valor constante da r. sentença, nos termos do art. 85, §11, do NCPC, observada a gratuidade de justiça a ela concedida –  Apelo improvido\". \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"mostrarOcultarEmenta cursorPointer\" src=\"/cjsg/imagens/saj/icoMenos.png\" height=\"12\" width=\"12\" border=\"0\" title=\"Visualizar Ementa Completa\"/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t<br /><br />\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"fundocinza1\">\n\t\t\t\t<td width=\"40\" align=\"left\" valign=\"top\" class=\"ementaClass\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<strong>10&nbsp;-</strong>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t<td valign=\"top\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\"  >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"ementaClass\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"esajLinkLogin downloadEmenta\" style=\"vertical-align: top\" title=\"Visualizar Inteiro Teor\" cdAcordao=\"20612002\" cdForo=\"0\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1068497-11.2021.8.26.0100\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"downloadEmenta\" cdAcordao=\"20612002\" cdForo=\"0\">&nbsp;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"imagens/saj/ico_pdf.gif\" border=\"0\" title=\"Visualizar inteiro teor\"/> <span class=\"downloadEmenta\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"textoSemFormatacao\" onclick=\"abrirPopUpDad